{"id":"u-39f639b8-bdf2-4a61-afae-3c0748f2665d","src":"community","title":"OFFWORLDER: Hypertrophy & Upper Body Focus","author":"AlamanderArts","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/qjb0Rw-custom-program","desc":"This weight-lifting program combines my favorite elements of Bald Omni-Man's Berserk Method and Damian Z's 4-Day Hypertrophy Program (Upper Body). \n\n- It alternates between two weeks to reduce repetition. While lower body days remain largely unchanged, the focus is primarily on the upper body. This program is designed to challenge your progressive overload significantly!\n\n- 4 days/week. I suggest going Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday. This will allow you to make a significant recovery with an adequate diet over your weekends, while giving you separation on Wednesdays to prepare for the second half of the week.\n\n- Most of these days also includes an ab exercise, or neck exercise. It is up to you whether you want to actually implement them in your workout.\n\nMonday: Upper, Push/Pull\nTuesday: Lower\nThursday: Upper, Arms/Shoulders Focus\nFriday: Lower & Back","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:23:28.998Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Body Push/Pull 1","Lower Power & Core","Upper Body, Arms/Shoulders 1","Lower & Back"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Wide Grip)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}],"note":"Rest 1 - 2 minutes"},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}],"note":"Rest 60 - 90 sec. Can get extra pump/reps by switching to narrow grip"},{"n":"Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 30 - 60 sec"},{"n":"Preacher Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Heavy weight. Keep cable close and at groin height."},{"n":"Single Arm Rear Delt Cable Fly","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Move cable to shoulder height! Draw the biggest arc you can"},{"n":"Wrist Curls","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 2 min. after superset. Go lighter weight in order to get full curl/rep in"}]},{"n":"Neck Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 1 -2 min, 3 - 4 sets. Use a soft towel to put on your head, for dumbbell"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}],"note":"Rest 2 - 3 minutes"},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 90 sec"},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 90 sec"},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 60 sec. Seated or Standing"},{"n":"Reverse Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 60 - 90 sec. Focus heavily on concentric movement, and go lighter weight"},{"n":"Shrug (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 90 - 120 seconds"},{"n":"Ab Wheel","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 60 - 90 seconds"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 60 - 90 sec / Set 1: Top chest / 2: Middle Chest / 3: Bottom Chest."},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}],"note":"Rest 1 - 2 min. Tricep focused dips"},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}],"note":"Rest 1 - 2 mins"},{"ss":[{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Use bar of preference for best stretch and best pump"},{"n":"Hammer Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest 1 - 2 mins. Choice of bicep exercise"}]},